Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Assess performance on new tasks that change surface details and require the intended concept. Distinguish independent transfer from success under hints, update the learner model conservatively, and retain evidence for instructor review.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
